    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b7520a2c4f26af31",
      "translationZh": "发布 ScreenSuite：最全面的 GUI 智能体评估套件！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "64459b6056cea83e",
      "translationZh": "太长不看版",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bbdd4da269954be2",
      "translationZh": "过去几周，我们一直在不懈努力，让 GUI 智能体更加开放、更易获取，也更易于集成。在这个过程中，我们创建了规模最大的 GUI 智能体性能基准测试套件 👉 让我们向大家介绍 ScreenSuite。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3aa8e674b8a350ea",
      "translationZh": "今天，我们非常兴奋地与大家分享：ScreenSuite 是评估视觉语言模型（VLMs）多种智能体能力的最全面、最便捷的方式！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "dd377a7345ed2ea5",
      "translationZh": "GUI 智能体到底是个啥？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3b8ec999e680ca5d",
      "translationZh": "运行中的 GUI 智能体——由 OSWorld 提供",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "694feebc386f63e4",
      "translationZh": "简而言之，AI 智能体就是在虚拟世界中行动的机器人。（更详尽的定义见此处）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6fd707c856eb86df",
      "translationZh": "具体来说，“GUI 智能体”就是存在于图形用户界面中的智能体。可以把它理解为“能在我的桌面或手机上点击和导航的智能体”，就像 Claude Computer Use 那样。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9800e19b05d38571",
      "translationZh": "这本质上意味着，驱动智能体的 AI 模型会收到一项任务，例如“填完这个 Excel 列的剩余部分”，以及 GUI 的屏幕截图。利用这些信息，它随后会决定在系统上执行操作：click(x=130, y=540) 来打开网页浏览器，type(”Value for XYZ in 2025\")，scroll(down=2) 来继续向下阅读……要观看 GUI 智能体的实际运行，你可以试试我们的 Open Computer Agent，它由 Qwen2.5-VL-72B 驱动。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a05ccda417fe3849",
      "translationZh": "一个优秀的 GUI 智能体能够像我们一样操作计算机，从而解锁所有计算机任务：浏览 Google Maps、编辑文件、在线购买商品。这涉及多种可能难以评估的能力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a89aad475f141910",
      "translationZh": "ScreenSuite 登场 🥳",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b9cdbaf4d62b2215",
      "translationZh": "相关文献，例如 Xu et al. (2025) 或 Qin et al. (2025)，通常将 GUI 智能体的能力划分为以下几类：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9e2a8d14686a8f80",
      "translationZh": "感知：正确感知屏幕上显示的信息",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "319d6eb11d54d8be",
      "translationZh": "定位：理解元素的位置——这对于点击正确的位置至关重要",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "af040833c36e04c9",
      "translationZh": "单步操作：通过一次操作正确完成指令",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9d790e2e3110c2c4",
      "translationZh": "多步智能体：在 GUI 环境中通过多个操作实现更高层次的目标。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5b83e68c2165a4c0",
      "translationZh": "因此，我们的第一项贡献是收集并整合了一套全面的基准测试，共包含 13 项，覆盖这些 GUI 智能体能力的全部范围。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1eba1049239a28f2",
      "translationZh": "如果你留意上面列出的最后一个类别，就会发现，评估多步骤智能体能力尤其具有挑战性，因为这需要用虚拟机来运行智能体的环境，无论是 Windows、Android，还是 Ubuntu……为了解决这一问题，我们既提供了对 E2B 桌面远程沙箱的支持，也从零开始创建了一种新方案，让你能够在 Docker 中轻松启动 Ubuntu 或 Android 虚拟机！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "292c06f0045a45d0",
      "translationZh": "类别",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
