      "translationZh": "实现细节",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d8292ec6326042e5",
      "translationZh": "我们在精心设计这套基准测试套件时充分考虑了模块化和一致性，确保各项任务和环境之间高度协调一致。在需要时，尤其是对于在线基准测试，我们采用 smolagents 作为框架层，以简化智能体的执行与编排。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cbde4dc0c8db8db3",
      "translationZh": "为支持可复现性并方便使用，我们构建了定制的 Docker 容器，支持在本地部署完整的 Ubuntu Desktop 或 Android 环境。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "38f29c6f2be70c6f",
      "translationZh": "许多现有的 GUI 基准测试除了视觉输入外，还依赖无障碍树或其他元数据；与之不同，我们的技术栈特意采用纯视觉方式。虽然这可能导致在某些现有排行榜上的得分有所不同，但我们认为，这样的设置更真实，也更具挑战性，能够更好地反映人类感知图形界面并与之交互的方式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8f2ffa5114691bf3",
      "translationZh": "– 所有智能体框架（Android World、OSWorld、GAIAWeb、Mind2Web）均使用 smolagents，并且完全依赖视觉，不额外使用任何无障碍树或 DOM（这与其他来源报告的评估设置不同）。– Mind2Web (Multimodal) 最初根据无障碍树和屏幕截图，使用基于元素名称的多项选择方式，后来改为仅依靠视觉来评估边界框内的点击精度，这显著增加了任务难度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "298031879132fd36",
      "translationZh": "主流 VLM 在 ScreenSuite 上的排名 📊",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6658dc2979571f45",
      "translationZh": "我们在该基准测试上评估了主流 VLM",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7ee0125e0ee793ad",
      "translationZh": "Qwen-2.5-VL 系列模型，规模从 3B 到 72B。这些模型以出色的定位能力著称，换句话说，它们知道图像中任意元素的坐标，因此适合需要精确点击的 GUI 智能体。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e264e31a8dfd854d",
      "translationZh": "UI-Tars-1.5-7B，ByteDance 推出的全能选手。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7c5c2fda53b7e2c6",
      "translationZh": "Holo1-7B，H company 推出的最新模型，就其规模而言，展现出了极为出色的定位性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "72b7a81e9022b7c9",
      "translationZh": "我们的得分与各方来源报告的得分总体一致！不过需要注意的是，我们仅基于视觉进行评估，因此会存在一些差异，详见上文的实现细节。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "781c68e99ca68d82",
      "translationZh": "💡 请注意，ScreenSuite 并不打算精确复现业内发布的基准测试：我们基于视觉来评估模型的 GUI 智能体能力。因此，在 Mind2Web 这类基准测试中，其他评测会让智能体看到 DOM 或无障碍树等信息丰富的上下文，而我们的评估设置要困难得多，所以 ScreenSuite 的结果与其他来源并不一致。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "67812bcc4442c612",
      "translationZh": "30 秒内开始你的自定义评估 ⚡️",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "20c83bb6b198a4ac",
      "translationZh": "前往代码仓库。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "31e38c1c4466382c",
      "translationZh": "克隆代码仓库及其子模块：git clone --recurse-submodules git@github.com:huggingface/screensuite.git",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "738992b008ce1b87",
      "translationZh": "安装软件包：uv sync --extra submodules --python 3.11",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2fd00544003e8ff4",
      "translationZh": "运行 python run.py",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c21b863f0cd95f51",
      "translationZh": "或者，运行 python examples/run_benchmarks.py 以获得更精细的控制，例如并行运行多个模型的评估。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4ad7f86a7fbbf58a",
      "translationZh": "多步骤基准测试需要一台裸机来运行和部署桌面/移动环境模拟器（参见 README.md）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ce75da2a9ff3d47c",
      "translationZh": "下一步 🚀",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c4a27b467cab5dd6",
      "translationZh": "轻松开展一致且有意义的评估，能让社区快速迭代并推动这一领域取得进展，正如我们在 Eleuther LM evaluation harness、Open LLM Leaderboard 和 Chatbot Arena 上所看到的那样。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e00443365deb6830",
      "translationZh": "我们希望在接下来的一个月里，看到能力强得多的开放模型，它们能够可靠地执行各种任务，甚至能在本地运行！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "42ddf592a989165e",
      "translationZh": "为支持这一努力：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
